      "date": "2026-05-03T12:05:44.000Z",
      "title": "INDIASHLTR: Upcoming Dividend Decision Will Support Bullish Long Term View",
      "body": "Analysts have kept the fair value estimate for India Shelter Finance steady at ₹1,002.63, citing only very small tweaks to assumptions such as the discount rate and future P/E that do not materially alter the overall price target view. What's in the News A board meeting will be held on May 2, 2026 to consider and approve the audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and financial year ended March 31, 2026, and to consider a final dividend on equity shares for that period (company filing).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
